---
# Privacy policy, overhaul v3 (WS5; art direction 3.7: reading column, H2 per topic). Wording is in
# _data/pages/privacy_policy.json and is the approved C-028 text: restyle only, no wording change.
# No request form on this page (the policy describes the form on the other pages). The call and
# text routes come from the WS2 action macro. JSON-LD: privacy-policy.11tydata.js.
layout: layouts/v3.njk
permalink: privacy-policy.html
slug: privacy-policy
page_key: privacy_policy
og_image: logo.png
bundles: ["service"]
---
{%- from "v3/actions.njk" import action with context -%}
{%- set pg = pages.privacy_policy -%}
<section class="ws5-hero ws5-hero--page ws5-hero--solo bg-ink-0" aria-labelledby="hero-h">
  <div class="ws5-hero__in">
    <div class="ws5-hero__copy">
      <h1 id="hero-h">{{ pg.hero.heading | safe }}</h1>
      <p class="t-label fg-2">{{ pg.updated.effective | safe }}<br>{{ pg.updated.previous_note | safe }}</p>
      {#- Peak pass R2 (visual N25): no booking block in a legal hero; the header and the call bar carry the call. -#}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{#- Peak pass R2 (visual R1 item 13, legal pages): an "On this page" index, H2s at 28 / 24 px and a 36em
    measure (ws5-read--legal in service/65-service.css). Wording unchanged (approved C-028 text). -#}
<section class="ws5-read ws5-read--legal bg-ink-0" aria-label="{{ pg.hero.heading | safe }}">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ws5-read__col">
      <p class="t-lead">{{ pg.intro | safe }}</p>
      <nav class="ws5-toc" aria-labelledby="toc-h"><p class="t-label fg-2" id="toc-h">On this page</p><ol class="list-plain">{% for s in pg.sections %}<li><a href="#pp-{{ loop.index }}">{{ s.heading | safe }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ol></nav>
{%- for s in pg.sections %}
      <h2 id="pp-{{ loop.index }}">{{ s.heading | safe }}</h2>
{%- for blk in s.blocks %}{% if blk.type == "p" %}
      <p>{{ blk.text | safe }}</p>
{%- elif blk.type == "ul" %}
      <ul>{% for li in blk.items %}<li>{{ li | safe }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
{%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
